  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "主持人心里藏着一个数学名词，孩子用是非题来猜，猜中就升一关，从“数学小萌新”一路挑战到“无穷解谜者”。",
    "en": "The host hides a math word; the child guesses with yes-or-no questions and levels up from Math Sprout to Infinity Puzzle Solver."
  },
